  "tool": "Built-in image_gen.imagegen for flat UI edits; original pixel CSS extraction for native UI",
  "prompts": {
    "prompt-1": "Use case: precise-object-edit. Convert the supplied product reference into a FULL FLAT DESKTOP SOFTWARE SCREENSHOT. Remove all physical monitor/laptop/tablet bezel, chin, stand and every physical smartphone. Keep the ENTIRE original desktop application UI from LEFT EDGE TO RIGHT EDGE: full brand/header, navigation sidebars, every table/chart column, labels, buttons and control icons must be present, with no words or content clipped. Preserve the original software module, branding, layout, colors, readable Korean text/numbers, logos and photo identities. Restore only UI hidden beneath the removed devices by continuing the existing panels or grid, never inventing unrelated modules or fake labels. Keep meaningful floating software dialogs/info cards fully visible inside the resulting image, with no clipped sides, and remove only presentation hardware. Render a single front-facing OPAQUE rectangular software screenshot edge-to-edge at the desktop UI's original aspect ratio, highest available resolution, high-quality PNG with sharp Korean glyphs. No black/white outside canvas, transparency holes, cutout photo backgrounds, perspective, hardware, phones, device-shaped corners, ground shadows, marketing headings, watermark or gibberish. Do not add words from a descriptive caption; keep only the text already present in the source.",
    "prompt-2": "Use case: precise-object-edit. Turn this reference into a FULL FLAT DESKTOP SOFTWARE SCREENSHOT, removing all physical monitor bezel, chin, stand and the overlapping smartphone. Retain the ENTIRE desktop application from its ORIGINAL LEFT EDGE TO RIGHT EDGE, including the whole header/brand, complete navigation sidebar, all buttons, all chart/table columns and labels. No cut-off words or controls. Restore only the small desktop UI area hidden by the removed phone by continuing the source UI grid/panel; do not invent a different module or fake labels. Preserve software layout, branding (WEHAGO/T edge as shown), all readable original Korean words and numbers, chart colors, logos, and fonts. Do not rename the product, add a marketing headline or omit sidebars. Keep floating SOFTWARE dialogs/info cards if any fully visible within the output. No hardware, phone, tablet, bezel, shadows or perspective. Render an OPAQUE clean rectangular desktop screenshot edge to edge, original desktop aspect ratio, highest resolution high-quality PNG, crisp text. No transparency holes, no cutout people, no clipped edges or outside background. Edit only presentation hardware; preserve UI meaning and visible text.",
    "prompt-3": "Use case: precise-object-edit. Convert the attached image to a FULL FLAT DESKTOP SOFTWARE SCREENSHOT for the Amaranth 10 video meeting UI. The ENTIRE rectangular software screenshot must be opaque including the complete office photo background on the left. Absolutely NO transparent holes or cutout subject, NO device frame, bezel, stand, smartphone, shadows or perspective. Remove only hardware and overlapping phone, restoring the lower-right blank pale-blue participant panel and bottom plus button beneath it. Preserve the whole UI from left to right, all control icons, names, text, title bar and four full thumbnails. No clipping any edge. Preserve original faces and all visible software pixels and readable Korean lettering. Top-left exact brand 'Amaranth 10', meeting badge '회의 참여시간 35분 14초/60분'. Keep the original desktop screenshot aspect ratio about 1174:724. High quality high resolution PNG. Fill the image edge to edge with the UI, no outside margin. Only reconstruct what the removed phone obscured; do not invent new labels or people."
  },
